  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the total volume of blood is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext></math>, initial activity <math><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></math> its activity at time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">t</mtext></math>,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub> <mi>A</mi> <mi>o</mi> </msub> <msup> <mi>e</mi> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi> </mrow> </msup> </mrow></math>, the activity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>x</mtext></math> volume,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3.7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mfrac><mn>300</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0.84</mn></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4.97</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4.97</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>liter</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math>.<br />&nbsp;",
